{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05236","headline":"赠皇甫侍御赴都八首 六 · 元希声","name":"赠皇甫侍御赴都八首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"载怀朋情，尝接闲宴。\n好洽昆弟，官联州县。\n如彼松竹，春荣冬蒨。\n柯叶蔼然，不渝霜霰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元希声","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05236.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05236","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}